      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "• Kafka KRaft: Topics listings.raw, listings.silver, user.interactions\n• Spark Streaming: clean_listings_job.py, clean_interactions_job.py\n• Spark Batch: aggregate_gold_job.py, silver_to_gold.py\n• Consumer PostgreSQL: consume_to_postgres.py écrit en base relationnelle\n• Architecture Médaillon: Bronze (Raw) → Silver (Clean) → Gold (Aggregated)",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "• Kafka KRaft: Topics listings.raw, listings.silver, user.interactions\n• Spark Streaming: clean_listings_job.py, clean_interactions_job.py\n• Spark Batch: aggregate_gold_job.py, silver_to_gold.py\n• Consumer PostgreSQL: consume_to_postgres.py écrit en base relationnelle\n• Architecture Médaillon: Bronze (Raw) → Silver (Clean) → Gold (Aggregated)",
      "lineHeight": 1.4
    },
